  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">displacement solutionsInitiative (DSI) conference in Copenhagen, 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFA during 2nd to 3rd April 2014 hosted Displacement Solutions Initiative (DSI) Roundtable II in its capacity as one of four presidents of DSI. DSI has besides Denmark also UNHCR, Colombians and one INGO as co-chairs.

The goal of the initiative is to find the solution to permanent displacements and innovation in terms of handling displaced persons at the earliest possible stage.

The conference aims to agree on a further operationalization of DSI as an inclusive global partnership. Will the conference be prepared a mission and vision statement for DSI with a view to adopting them and work on a plan for future impact on policies and strategies of the development actor.</narrative>
  </description>
